    "description": "Discover the ultimate streaming companion for entertainment fans! Select your preferred streaming services to unlock personalized recommendations made just for you. Create and customize your own watchlist, rate/review and share movies and shows or watch trending trailers each week. Download the free app to navigate the vast sea of entertainment choices like never before. \r\n\r\nIMDb is available worldwide in English, Spanish, German, French, Portuguese, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Taiwanese, and Hindi. Do you think we're doing something well? Is there something we've overlooked? Please post your feedback at http://spr.ly/IMDbApp_Android",
